{"seq":8,"slug":"swarm-robotics","title":"群体机器人","stage":"DONE","category":"robotics-automation","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 群体机器人\n\n这是一份从原理到落地的群体机器人读本，主线只有一条：如何让一大群简单、廉价、能力受限的机器人，仅凭局部感知与局部交互，涌现出单个个体根本不具备的协调集体行为。整本 hub 按四个递进的层级展开，每一层都在为下一层铺路。\n\n第一层「群体智能基础」回答最根本的问题：什么是群体、涌现从何而来、为什么放弃个体的强大反而能换来群体的可扩展与鲁棒。它确立了贯穿全书的核心张力——我们能写的只有局部规则，想要的却是全局行为，而两者之间隔着一道难以反向跨越的「设计鸿沟」，并交代了生物（蚁、蜂、鸟）给我们的自组织灵感。\n\n第二层「协调与通信」把这道鸿沟落到去中心化的数学骨架上：用通信图与拉普拉斯矩阵刻画「谁能和谁说话」，用共识算法解决「如何在无人指挥下达成一致」，用任务分配解决「谁去做什么」。这一层是所有具体集体行为的协调地基。\n\n第三层「集群算法」在前两层之上，给出三类最核心的群体行为算法——聚集与编队（如何成形）、觅食与搜索（如何找东西）、蜂拥与避碰（如何协调运动且绝不相撞）。这是把基础原理变成可运行行为的工程层。\n\n第四层「系统与应用」把仿真里的理想算法搬到真实硬件上：讲清系统架构、定位与通信的工程现实、无人机集群这一最受瞩目的应用形态，最后横向收口全部应用全景与尚未解决的开放挑战——可验证性、安全攻防、仿真到现实与千台可扩展。四层读下来，你会看到一条清晰的脉络：从「为什么群体可行」到「如何让它可行」，再到「让它在天上和废墟里真的可行」。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"群体智能基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"swarm-intelligence-emergence","title":"群体智能与涌现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/foundations/swarm-intelligence-emergence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bio-inspired-self-organization","title":"生物启发与自组织","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/foundations/bio-inspired-self-organization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"local-rules-global-behavior","title":"局部规则与全局行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/foundations/local-rules-global-behavior"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"coordination","title":"协调与通信","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/coordination","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"distributed-coordination","title":"分布式协调机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/coordination/distributed-coordination"},{"seq":2,"slug":"communication-consensus","title":"通信与共识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/coordination/communication-consensus"},{"seq":3,"slug":"task-allocation","title":"任务分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/coordination/task-allocation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"algorithms","title":"集群算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aggregation-formation","title":"聚集与编队","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/algorithms/aggregation-formation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"foraging-search","title":"觅食与搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/algorithms/foraging-search"},{"seq":3,"slug":"flocking-collision-avoidance","title":"蜂拥与避碰","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/algorithms/flocking-collision-avoidance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"系统与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-robot-architecture","title":"多机器人系统架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/applications/multi-robot-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"drone-swarms","title":"无人机集群","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/applications/drone-swarms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications-challenges","title":"应用与挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/applications/applications-challenges"}]}]}